# MEREOLOGY facts sample (ConceptNet /r/PartOf / WordNet meronym export, one pair per line "part whole",
# directional part->whole, source is part, target is whole)
#
# **MEREOLOGY != IS_A** (part-whole != subset): part-of is meronymic (wheel part-of car), distinct from
# child->parent subset IS_A (dog is-a mammal). EDGE_MEREOLOGY=25 typed edge, orthogonal to EDGE_IS_A,
# static base strength, not reward-connected / not in PR adjacency / dag_path doesn't traverse /
# closure doesn't close (mirrors EDGE_IS_A structural-edge discipline).
#
# **directional**: part in front, whole at end (ConceptNet PartOf = part TAB whole, clean export).
# load_mereology_facts_file takes parts[0]=part / parts[-1]=whole. bootstrap_mereology_edges builds
# EDGE_MEREOLOGY part->whole directed edge. Self-loop (part==whole) skipped.
# Closure defer (mereology transitive closure part-of transitivity needs independent design; closure
# first version EDGE_IS_A only).
#
# **not core data** (iron law "no hardcode", same as antonym/is_a facts):
#   - core code never imports this file, core doesn't know pair contents; loader
#     (collection.resolve_mereology_facts) is pluggable; production default no file -> resolve [] ->
#     boot zero side effects -> bit-identical.
#   - mereology facts is external part-whole assertions (ConceptNet PartOf objective, source (1)
#     EPI_STRUCTURED, not teacher judgment, #479).
#
# Usage: user exports ConceptNet /r/PartOf to this format, place at $PURE_INTEGER_AI_LOCAL_DIR/mereology_facts_en.txt.
# formal_train boot reads this -> bootstrap_mereology_edges builds EDGE_MEREOLOGY (part->whole, static).
#
# Honest boundary: file truth/quality = external data responsibility (grounding wall, #479); system
# does not judge, only seeds edges. This sample is dev/illustration only; production user supplies
# ConceptNet/WordNet export.

# physical part-whole
wheel car
engine car
finger hand
toe foot
branch tree
leaf tree
page book
room house
door house
leg table

# functional part-whole
key keyboard
screen laptop
wheel bicycle
hand clock
